{"title":"Sand Jackal","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 22 Desert Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: packDamagePerAlly: .06 | fleeHpFraction: .2</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sand-jackal\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-jackal?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-jackal?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-jackal?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-jackal?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>6</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 25 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 80% of 25 looted corpses, 20 recorded drops, 20 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">80% · 20/25</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackal-pelt\" title=\"Jackal Pelt - in 64% of 25 looted corpses, 16 recorded drops, 40 total, 1–6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackal Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">64% · 16/25</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sunbleached-fang\" title=\"Sunbleached Fang - in 60% of 25 looted corpses, 15 recorded drops, 44 total, 1–6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sunbleached Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">60% · 15/25</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 25 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 54 total, 12–26 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/25</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+6 more\">+6 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-feet\" title=\"Bearhide Feet (leopard x1) - in 12% of 25 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/194881d2e0ebbc92b3cd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">12% · 3/25</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 2 of 3 · Good: 1 of 3 · Enchanted: 1 of 3</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\" title=\"Stamina Potion Medium - in 8% of 25 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 2/25</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"deerhide-feet\" title=\"Deerhide Feet - in 4% of 25 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/95c89d9d1f55b930cc0a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deerhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4% · 1/25</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"leather-legs\" title=\"Leather Legs - in 4% of 25 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/90624d3f11b4f85c3eb3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Leather Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4% · 1/25</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Crude: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-arms\" title=\"Bearhide Arms - in 4% of 25 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9da825311bcf4ccc4c8a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4% · 1/25</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-legs\" title=\"Bearhide Legs - in 4% of 25 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d5f0c0f64a5f6fd492e9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4% · 1/25</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 16 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 14 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sand-jackal\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Desert Wolf: <a href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf\">Desert Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha\">Dune Alpha</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/bb7ca40cbe335f3fe02d.webp\" alt=\"Sand Jackal\"></div><h3>Sand Jackal</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>22 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 20–23)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Desert Wolf</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>74</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>16.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.0 s</td